{"availability":"available","full":"maitrungduc1410/loader-kit","name":"loader-kit","description":"Loading and progress indicators as JSON, rendered natively on Android, iOS, macOS, Windows and the web. 50 built-ins and 50 progress designs, one spec, the same motion on every platform.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-06T14:00:42Z","updated":"2026-10-11T04:03:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://maitrungduc1410.github.io/loader-kit/","topics":["activity-indicator","android","animation","ios","jetpack-compose","json","kotlin","loader","loading-animation","loading-indicator","macos","progress-bar","swift","swiftui","typescript","uikit","windows","winui"],"demo":"https://maitrungduc1410.github.io/loader-kit/tools/playground","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:39.926Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:39.926Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:39.926Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:39.926Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Loading indicators described as data and rendered natively on Android, iOS, macOS, Windows and the web.","The 50 built-in indicators and the 50 progress designs. Try them with your own colors, size and speed in the indicator gallery and the progress gallery, or build a new indicator in the playground.","Each indicator is a small JSON spec: elements laid out in a unit box, and keyframe tracks for their scale, opacity, rotation and translation. Every platform engine reads the same spec and follows the same rules (SPEC.md), checked against a shared conformance suite (test-vectors/), so an indicator looks and moves the same everywhere. There are 50 built-in indicators, some with params (count, minScale), and you can write your own (experimental)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/maitrungduc1410/loader-kit/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"eac4e0c9d1dc3b2c3016a8f421